    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Pell Ostry</strong> keeps a pneumatic terminal the Exchange lists on no active route. A sentient skeleton missing both legs below the knee, he rides a counterweighted chair along a short rail (speed 10 ft on the floor, 40 ft along his rail). Short sentences, railway-clerk precise, dry; his pocket watch has no hands.</p><p><strong>GM notes (Part 7).</strong> [SECRET] Thaw member: keeps the cold door's timetable and the courier post, and sends the Part 6 capsules. Loyal to \"V.\" (Venfyura; never named this session). The far end is the camp: Insight DC 13 with Europa's frost and Mottle's receipt. His frost jar feeds T2 (frost match DC 14, one Rime dose). Scene 7 is at his terminal.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
