    {
      "_id": "91526951d3860ac5",
      "name": "GM Reference: Pell Ostry, Voice and Terminal",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Pell Ostry, Keeper of the Dusty Terminal</h2><p><em>\"Usual time. Single clunk. Never early.\"</em></p><p><strong>Body:</strong> a sentient skeleton missing both legs below the knee, who rides a counterweighted iron chair along a short rail in the terminal room. <strong>Speed 10 ft on the floor, 40 ft along his rail.</strong> Very fast on the rail, very slow on the floor.</p><p><strong>Job:</strong> nominal keeper of a pneumatic terminal the Exchange lists as being on no active route. Nobody remembers giving him the job; nobody has taken it away.</p><p><strong>[SECRET] Thaw role:</strong> keeps the cold door's timetable; receives and sends the Thaw's capsules at the usual time; lets the courier (Europa's brother [SUGGESTED], name [UNSETTLED]) through. Old loyalty to the woman at the fire on the other side of the door: <strong>Venfyura</strong> (SETTLED). He writes \"V.\" and never names her aloud; he will not confirm who she is this session.</p><p><strong>Quill:</strong> keeps his door's anchor running. He calls Quill \"the grammarian\" and means it fondly.</p><p><strong>Note lead (Part 6):</strong> Pell is who sends \"Drop off at the usual time.\" The notes are the Thaw's capsules. If you want that lead kept separate, have him use knocks instead.</p><p><strong>Voice:</strong> short sentences, railway-clerk precise, dry. Checks a pocket watch with no hands.</p><h3>Sample dialogue</h3><ul><li>[COMMON] \"No route. No logging. No visitors. You're visiting.\"</li><li>[ASK] \"Usual time is when the last trolley passes. One minute. Not two.\"</li><li>[ASK] <em>(the frost jar)</em> \"From the gorge. Doesn't melt. Not all the way. That's how you know the edge is close.\"</li><li>[EARN] \"Capsules come through with news. Lately it's bailiffs, black wagons, and a quiet Reave.\"</li><li>[EARN, Europa only] \"The man who carried you in came through my door. Said you'd be angry. Said to tell you the time is right, and he's at the fire.\"</li><li>[EARN] \"Someone's been counting my minutes. Tall fellow. Measuring chain.\"</li><li><em>(to Lil)</em> \"Don't touch the lever.\" <em>(Lil: \"What lever?\" Pell: \"Exactly.\")</em></li></ul><p><strong>Jar of gorge frost (GM):</strong> yields 1 Rime dose (Potency 1, never fully melts), then it is empty. Dale's T2 frost match (DC 14) uses it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Varrenmoor DM Guide, Part 7 (Session 14)",
          "book": "",
