    {
      "_id": "e03a1b72b29d0210",
      "name": "Lore Reference: News From Bridgehollow",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>News From Bridgehollow (capsule contents)</h2><p>[EARN] <em>\"Capsules come through with news. Lately it's bailiffs, black wagons, and a quiet Reave.\"</em></p><ul><li>The Regarder came; the Reave vanished.</li><li>Iron Bailiffs guard a black caravan; Haywards patrol the fields.</li><li>People whisper about Fen-Reivers near the gorge (rumor only: tracks, a missing goat, claw marks in snow).</li><li>[EARN] Older capsules: \"Bailiffs took the bell's tongue.\"</li><li>[EARN] From \"V.\": the Goddess has noticed. (\"She's looking.\")</li></ul><p>The Thaw reads all this as the Niorghast's people moving. Old letters from the far side are EARN to read; he will not say who \"V.\" is.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Varrenmoor DM Guide, Part 7 (Session 14)",
