    {
      "_id": "0ee8f9d3c46b166f",
      "name": "Side Quest: The Usual Time",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Side Quest: The Usual Time (Part 7, Scene 7)</h2><p><strong>Hook:</strong> be at the cold door at the usual time for the test pull.</p><ul><li>Needs T1 (anchor), T2 (wire and Rime dose) and T3 (strand); the braid from T6.</li><li>Someone rings Nan's bell in the Bell knock (four slow) while Violet holds the strand and Stellan watches the anchor: Performance or Wisdom <strong>DC 12</strong>.</li><li>Success: the door opens for its minute. A capsule drops through: <em>\"Bell silent. Clapper taken to the Customs House. Bailiffs on the road. V. keeps the fire.\"</em> Then the frost writes the name on the Stolen Shard.</li><li>If they refuse the Thaw, Pell still brings them the capsule: <em>\"You should know anyway.\"</em></li></ul><p><strong>Reward:</strong> passage through the cold door onto the mountain road above Bridgehollow (saves the long road).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
